---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/CTABanner.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Community Relations & CSR | Vrosk Energies"
  description="Explore Vrosk Energies' commitment to community partnerships, local content development, and corporate social responsibility in West Africa."
  currentPath="/community-relations-csr"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 50px; background: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(22,21,21,0.06);">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 840px;">
        <div class="badge-pill mint">
          <span class="badge-dot"></span>
          <span>Social Impact & Community Partnerships</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="heading-1" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
          Community Relations & Corporate Social Responsibility
        </h1>
        <p class="body-lead">
          At Vrosk Energies, we recognize the vital role that community relations and CSR play in our operations. We are committed to building long-lasting relationships with host communities and delivering enduring value beyond our core balance sheet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Detailed Pillars -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bento-hero-grid" style="margin-bottom: 56px;">
        <div class="bento-card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: 44px;">
          <div class="mono-tag" style="color: #0b4026; margin-bottom: 14px;">COMMUNITY FIRST</div>
          <h2 class="heading-2" style="font-size: 1.85rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            Fostering Transparent Partnerships & Mutual Respect
          </h2>
          <p class="body-regular" style="margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
            Our community relations strategy is centered on fostering genuine partnerships. We believe that energy operations must bring tangible, measurable uplift to the people who inhabit our operating localities.
          </p>
          <p class="body-regular" style="margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
            Through proactive consultations with community elders, youth leadership councils, and local government stakeholders, we establish trust well before commencing operations. Our CSR investments focus on sustainable human capital: technical vocational training, localized subcontracting, clean water initiatives, and educational scholarships.
          </p>
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;">
            <div style="background: var(--bg-color); padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
              <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;">Local Content Hiring</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">Prioritizing indigenous personnel and logistics contractors across terminal and haulage hubs.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-color); padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
              <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;">Educational Support</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">Providing secondary and STEM scholarships to empower the next generation of energy engineers.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
          <div class="bento-card-dark" style="background: var(--dark-surface-01);">
            <div class="mono-tag" style="color: var(--theme-color-01); margin-bottom: 12px;">SUSTAINED COMMITMENT</div>
            <h3 class="heading-3" style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
              Host Community Equity
            </h3>
            <p style="color: #a8a4a4; font-size: 0.925rem; line-height: 1.6;">
              "Ensuring that our stakeholders and immediate communities are treated with equity, respect and honesty." We do not treat CSR as an afterthought—it is core to our corporate license to operate.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-card" style="background: #ffffff;">
            <div class="mono-tag" style="color: #0b4026; margin-bottom: 12px;">ENERGY ACCESS</div>
            <h3 class="heading-3" style="font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
              Clean Fuel Transition for Families
            </h3>
            <p class="body-regular" style="font-size: 0.925rem; line-height: 1.6;">
              Through our LPG commercialization drive, we facilitate subsidized access to clean cooking gas cylinders, helping reduce respiratory illnesses caused by wood smoke.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABanner />
</BaseLayout>
